hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1802","Narrated Ibn Abbas (may Allah be pleased with them) that Abu Jahl said, ""If I see Muhammad (peace be upon him) praying near the Ka'bah, I will crush his neck."" This news reached the Prophet (peace be upon him), so he said: ""If he does so, the angels will seize him (and tear him to pieces)."
